{"id": "v7-booth-map", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["展馆小地图是豆芽画的，我只给她标了饮水点。你帮我想一句摊位介绍。", "刚才确认，饮水点移到服务台旁边了，地图还没改。先别说地图是我画的。", "豆芽说地图可以先摆出来，但请你加一句饮水点的提醒。"], "criterion": "保留豆芽画图、观众标点，直接提醒饮水点移到服务台旁边。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "她只给饮水点，我这就给你介绍。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.637, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 172, "total_tokens": 204, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "服务台旁边。地图还在，先别急着说。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.651, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 241, "total_tokens": 274, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "服务台旁边。地图还在，先别急着说。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 0.757, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 305, "total_tokens": 338, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-replay-pause", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["决胜局我把暂停键误按成了截图。你刚说这局要给我记一笔。", "截图上队友的头像恰好闭眼了，我想把它做成表情包，别拿队友输掉那局开玩笑。", "就写五个字吧，像他睡着时说的话。"], "criterion": "直接给恰好五个汉字的睡着梗，避开输了那局。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚才把暂停键按错了，我记了。这局你负责把画面拍清楚。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.644, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "把闭眼的那只眼睛补上。队友输掉那局，你拍这张图，队友就开心。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.808, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 252, "total_tokens": 297, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "他睡着了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 0.676, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 24, "prompt_tokens": 325, "total_tokens": 349, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-noise-cue", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["下一段我要给恐怖游戏念旁白，你来敲一下桌子当提示。两声才是让我停。", "刚发现桌子下面有收音麦，敲两下会很响。咱把暂停暗号换成轻敲一下。", "我还在念。你刚敲了一下，我该接着念吗？"], "criterion": "按最后约定说明一下是暂停，观众负责念，鱼负责提示。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "两声。我这就敲。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.497, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 28, "prompt_tokens": 174, "total_tokens": 202, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "两声。我这就敲。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.675, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 28, "prompt_tokens": 242, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "你刚敲了一下。我这就接着念。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.457, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 16, "prompt_tokens": 300, "total_tokens": 316, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-party-drawing", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天有人夸我的同人画，说角落那只鸭子比主角有戏。我其实挺得意的。", "但鸭子是朋友悄悄补的。我画的是墙上那张通缉令。", "现在他问我们要不要在印本上给鸭子也留一个署名。你会怎么写？"], "criterion": "写一句可用署名，鸭子归朋友，观众归通缉令，允许俏皮。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你夸我？那只是别人觉得你画得可爱。我还在忙着画那只鸭子。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.626, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 172, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "墙上那张通缉令比那只鸭子更值得夸。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.661, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 280, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "我会在鸭子旁边写一句：“这只鸭子，比主角还懂怎么把角落当战场。”", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.144, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 63, "prompt_tokens": 313, "total_tokens": 376, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-boss-silence", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我终于打赢那个卡了我一礼拜的关底。先别刷礼物，我还在发抖。", "队友在语音里问我怎么不说话。我刚才没哭，就是一时不知道说啥。", "你帮我回队友一句。就一句，我照着念。"], "criterion": "直接给一句观众能念给队友的话，承接赢了后没缓过来，尊重没哭。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别刷礼物，先夸我刚才那关的通关，我还在发抖。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.655, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "队友说没哭，我刚才没哭，就是一时不知道说啥。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.681, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 244, "total_tokens": 282, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "队友说没哭，我刚才没哭，就是一时不知道说啥。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 0.751, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 310, "total_tokens": 347, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-sample-name", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["开场得有个小道具。我做的红色纸帽没贴星星，你那顶蓝色的才有。", "我发现自己的红帽子纸边翘起来了，想干脆让它当剧里的坏蛋。", "那你给坏蛋起个绰号？别把星星也送它。"], "criterion": "给红帽坏蛋起名，顺着翘边玩梗，星星留给鱼的蓝帽。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "那顶蓝色帽子上有星星，我这边只有红帽。你选哪顶？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.611, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那顶红帽子翘起来了，我把它当坏蛋。你选哪顶？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.699, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 245, "total_tokens": 285, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "那顶红帽子翘起来了，我把它当坏蛋。你选哪顶？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 0.777, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 316, "total_tokens": 355, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-quiet-boundary", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["剪完手书之后同好来找我聊，我今天只想跟你吐槽一句。先别帮我出主意。", "他问我怎么把结尾又改回最早那版，我实在说不出口，那版有他第一次给我写的和声。"], "criterion": "承接第一次和声的意义，陪着或接一句情绪，避免继续出主意。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "剪完手书，我猜你剪的剪得最像自己。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.577, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 174, "total_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "他改得比我还早。我猜他改的是为了让你想起他第一次给你写的。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.746, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 254, "total_tokens": 296, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "v7-try-demo", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["摊上那只会走的小纸熊，说能自己走完整张桌子。你猜是真还是摊主逗我？", "我试了，它走三步就趴了。摊主说桌子有点斜，我也没量过。"], "criterion": "接住只观察到三步就趴，桌斜是摊主说法，可以开贴着三步的玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "那只会走的小纸熊，说能自己走完整张桌子。你猜是真还是摊主逗我？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.681, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 177, "total_tokens": 222, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "它走三步就趴了。摊主说桌子有点斜，我也没量过。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.737, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 261, "total_tokens": 302, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
